# Friend Requests II: Who Has the Most Friends

## Problem Summary
Write a query to find the user who has the highest total number of accepted friend requests, considering both requesters and accepters.

## Solution

```sql
SELECT id, COUNT(*) AS num
FROM (
    SELECT accepter_id AS id FROM RequestAccepted
    UNION ALL
    SELECT requester_id AS id FROM RequestAccepted
) t
GROUP BY id
ORDER BY num DESC
LIMIT 1;
```
